  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original653 complete living horned adult, with bifurcating rostral horn and paired postorbital horns. Do not reduce to skull. [\"Body posture, coat, sex assignment of the restored living individual and soft tissues are reconstruction choices. Horn-bearing adult form chosen to preserve original scope.\", \"UF16154 is not the horned skull. Do not claim its missing horns prove damage or sex; it only calibrates approximate cranial size.\", \"Museum painting is a curated artistic reconstruction, not direct evidence of coat colors or exact body dimensions.\", \"Horn surface coverage and details not scientifically resolved here; restrained smooth material without decorative rings.\"] {\"unit\": \"meter\", \"cranial_length_m\": 0.34, \"cranial_length_status\": \"Approximate photo-derived UF16154 dimension: skull approx880px versus10cmbar256px =>34cm. Not a direct specimen measurement and not the horned FAM33407 measurement.\", \"body_length_m\": 1.7, \"shoulder_height_m\": 1.0, \"body_size_status\": \"Artistic proportion estimates for a deer-like whole organism; not measured skeleton dimensions.\", \"horn_shaft_height_m\": 0.35, \"horn_dimension_status\": \"Artistic relative proportion from horned skull photograph; perspective prevents precise measurement.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original653 complete living horned adult, with bifurcating rostral horn and paired postorbital horns. Do not reduce to skull. [\"Body posture, coat, sex assignment of the restored living individual and soft tissues are reconstruction choices. Horn-bearing adult form chosen to preserve original scope.\", \"UF16154 is not the horned skull. Do not claim its missing horns prove damage or sex; it only calibrates approximate cranial size.\", \"Museum painting is a curated artistic reconstruction, not direct evidence of coat colors or exact body dimensions.\", \"Horn surface coverage and details not scientifically resolved here; restrained smooth material without decorative rings.\"] {\"unit\": \"meter\", \"cranial_length_m\": 0.34, \"cranial_length_status\": \"Approximate photo-derived UF16154 dimension: skull approx880px versus10cmbar256px =>34cm. Not a direct specimen measurement and not the horned FAM33407 measurement.\", \"body_length_m\": 1.7, \"shoulder_height_m\": 1.0, \"body_size_status\": \"Artistic proportion estimates for a deer-like whole organism; not measured skeleton dimensions.\", \"horn_shaft_height_m\": 0.35, \"horn_dimension_status\": \"Artistic relative proportion from horned skull photograph; perspective prevents precise measurement.\"}"
